<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Rugby Union-Brial to lead Australia in Fiji sevens.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Rugby Union-Brial to lead Australia in Fiji sevens.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wallaby forward Michael Brial will captain Australia at the Fiji International Sevens in Suva on March 7 and 8.</p>
<p>Hosts Fiji beat New Zealand to win last year's tournament after defeating Australia in the semifinal.</p>
<p>Australia - Michael Brial (captain), Ryan Constable, Ben Dunn, Mepi Faoagali, David Grimmond, David Kelaher, John Moss, Matthew Mostyn, Semi Taupeaafe, Jim Williams.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
